| [The \(N\mid f'(m)\) event](/Volumes/git/factoring-connection/notes/lv6_results.md:468) | **CORRECT** | The affine offset changes, but the constant coefficient of \(R_c\) still enters with unit coefficient \(g_1\). Thus the probability remains at most \(1/(2H+1)\). |
